# No Competitor Comparison Pages

The owner removed all `/compare/*` pages (Loyverse, Foodics, Odoo POS) deliberately. Do not bring them back.

- NEVER create pages, routes, or content comparing Cashvio to a named competitor (no `/compare/*`, no "Cashvio vs X" pages or titles).
- `next.config.ts` permanently redirects `/compare/:path*` and `/ar/compare/:path*` to the homepage. Keep these redirects; old URLs may still be indexed.
- Allowed: generic comparison SECTIONS inside feature pages using `ComparisonTable` against unnamed "generic platforms" (see the `arabicPos` page's comparison section). The distinction: generic category comparisons are fine, named-competitor pages are not.
- Do not add competitor names to keywords arrays, titles, or JSON-LD.
